#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:8
msgid "block-devices interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`block-devices` provides the ability to perform operations on raw disk block "
"devices (e.g. `/dev/sda`, `/dev/mmcblk0`). This interface grants privileged "
"access to the device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:12
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"This interface controls a resource shared by the whole system. Snaps that "
"use it can be installed as parallel instances, but every instance acts on "
"the same system resource and snapd does not coordinate between them. Make "
"sure each instance manages different resources, or run only one instance at "
"a time. See {ref}`Snaps that are unsupported as parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-shared-resources>` for details.."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:19
msgid "Requires snapd version _2.37+_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:21
msgid ""
"When the plug sets `allow-partitions` boolean attribute to `true`, the "
"interface will grant access to individual partition devices (e.g. `/dev/"
"sda1`, `/dev/mmcblk0p1`). The plug needs to be declared in the following "
"manner:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:23
msgid ""
"plugs:\n"
"  block-devices:\n"
"    allow-partitions: true\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:28
msgid "The `allow-partitions` attribute requires snapd version *2.71+*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/block-devices-interface.md:30
msgid ""
"Consumers of this interface require a {ref}`snap declaration <interfaces-"
"process-for-aliases-auto-connections-and-tracks>` for distribution via the "
"Snap Store."
msgstr ""
